en:
"F-fine, go, then!
Just try not to come crawling back
with your tail between your legs!"{w}

"Blubbering?
Why would I ever blubber over you, Soara... As if!
I-I don't even get what you're saying!"{w}

"I am Rondelgius.{w}Sovereign of dragons -- in other words, the Dragon Lord!"{w}{p}"I hear you lot are rather capable.{w}...However!{w}Can you overcome MY trials?"{w}{p}"Come! If you wish to grow even stronger,
then take up my trials!"{w}{p}"You can do it!
I know you can do it!!"{w}

"That's the spirit!{w}Then here is the first trial!{w}The trial ground is... the Flotban Snowfield!!"{w}{p}"Flotban is a land of bitter cold.{w}Without protection against the cold,
you'll freeze just walking around!"{w}{p}"Bring me back the Ice Strawberries
that are said to grow there!!"{w}

"Now, I shall hand down the next trial!{w}The next trial ground is... Heerdahl!!"{w}{p}"They say an unknown apparition appears
in a bunker on the golf course there!{w}Challenge that apparition and beat it!"{w}{p}"Now go, adventurers!{w}Your hot blood, your very soul!
Let them come bursting out!!"{w}{p}"I shall await your return here.{w}I pray for your success."{w}

"Magnificent!{w}Your power is nothing ordinary!!"{w}{p}"That anomaly in that space
will surely never happen again!!"{w}{p}"I have no grounds for it,
but I am certain of it!!"{w}

"But still,
this Dragon Centaur V or whatever --
just who could it be, I wonder?"{w}

"Come on, come on, any song requests?{w}Classics, folk songs, nursery rhymes --
Haleorat here will play them for you!"{w}{p}"A song from your hometown, that old tune you miss,
whatever you like!"{w}

"Nope, old man. Get lost."{w}{p}"New songs are nice too, but old songs
are packed with the feelings of the people who came before.
Man, the romance of it!"{w}

"Wait, but... Hm?{w}That's weird... what language is this?{w}It isn't Spirit Script either... I can't read this."{w}{p}"Maybe this sheet music was written
long, long before we'd ever imagine."{w}{p}"Even the oldest folk songs I know
don't use letters or words like these.{w}Isn't there anyone who could decipher it..."{w}

"No, no, no, wait just a MOMENT!!"{w}{p}"Whyyy is some lowly huuuman heeere~~!!
Do not flaunt that vulgar faaace
before meee~! Be GONE!!"{w}

"I bought an old painting from a peddler, you see.
It is called the Forsaken Painting 'Morning of Ruin'."{w}{p}"An ominous name, is it not?{w}I wanted to know what sort of history lies behind it."{w}{p}"I have had all manner of people look into it...{w}and in that painting were the very same letters as these."{w}{p}" ┤┯├┌┷ ┗┫┷┴├┯ ┿┯┿┳┌

   That is what it says. Rather similar, wouldn't you say?"{w}
